        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_02",
      "hash64": "E12A2C57CA10DBF8",
      "text": "Hello, buenos, saluuut !\\c\\nPlace à Mashynn, place à ma chaîne !\\nLa reine de la Toile Élek va mettre l’ambiance ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_01",
      "hash64": "09252C6E0C8AF7B4",
      "text": "Euh... C’est vous, la Championne ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_02",
      "hash64": "09252F6E0C8AFCCD",
      "text": "Hello, buenos, saluuut !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03a",
      "hash64": "AB88D62C5AA8DE3E",
      "text": "Eh oui, ici, c’est moi la Championne, mais\\nsur Internet, j’suis Mashynn : créatrice de contenu\\r\\nvidéo et influenceuse du tonnerre ! Enchantée ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03b",
      "hash64": "AB88D52C5AA8DC8B",
      "text": "Oh !!! Tu connais déjà mon jargon !\\nJ’sens qu’on va bien s’entendre ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03",
      "hash64": "E12A2D57CA10DDAB",
      "text": "Tu t’attendais peut-être pas à ça ? Bah, t’sais\\nquoi ? J’ai une autre surprise pour toi !\\r\\nOn est en liiive dans le monde entier, hahaha ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_04",
      "hash64": "E12A3257CA10E62A",
      "text": "En tout cas, c’est sympa de ta part d’être venu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\njusqu’ici ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_05",
      "hash64": "E12A3357CA10E7DD",
      "text": "Vraiment, ça m’fait hyper plaisir. Mais au cas où\\nt’aurais pas remarqué, j’suis assez occupée,\\r\\nparce que j’suis pas n’importe qui.[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_06",
      "hash64": "E12A3057CA10E2C4",
      "text": "Donc j’veux être sûre que tu vas faire le buzz...\\c\\nAhem... ! J’veux dire... j’dois m’assurer que\\ntu vas te donner à fond ! Ho ho ho ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_07",
      "hash64": "E12A3157CA10E477",
      "text": "Donc en gros, si tu veux t’battre contre moi,\\nva falloir faire en sorte que ce stream marche\\r\\ndu tonnerre ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_08",
      "hash64": "E12A2657CA10D1C6",
      "text": "T’as l’air hyper motivé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, ça fait plaisir ! Du coup,\\nje t’explique le plan. Tu vas voir, c’est tout bête ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_20",
      "hash64": "E1232257CA0AAC4C",
      "text": "Mais avant ça, j’appelle notre invité d’honneur...\\nMonsieur Ducoin ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "3DA8B550A77FB5A5",
      "text": "Tiens donc, m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0B07)]onsieurademoiselle [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nQuel heureux hasard.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0B07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_09",
      "hash64": "E12A2757CA10D379",
      "text": "Mais whaaaaat ?!\\nTu connais déjà ce type ?![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_17",
      "hash64": "E12DB157CA13F3CE",
      "text": "Tant mieux, parce que moi, j’le connais pas\\ndu tout, en fait ! Ha ha ha !\\c\\nJe l’ai juste trouvé au coin de la rue, et j’ai adoré\\nsa vibe, donc je l’ai recruté pour mon stream ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "3DA8B250A77FB08C",
      "text": "Ho ho ho... C’est un honneur.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_18",
      "hash64": "E12DAC57CA13EB4F",
      "text": "Et donc, que doit faire notre challenger,\\nme demanderez-vous ? C’est tout simple !\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], tu vas devoir jouer à cache-\\ncache avec notre bon pote, monsieur Ducoin ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_10",
      "hash64": "E12DB457CA13F8E7",
      "text": "Utilise les caméras de surveillance de la ville pour\\nrepérer où monsieur Ducoin se cache !\\c\\nRetrouve-le trois fois, et ton examen d’Arène\\nsera dans la poche ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_11",
      "hash64": "E12DB357CA13F734",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, j’ai l’titre parfait pour ce p’tit jeu !\\c\\n« Cache-cache en ville avec monsieur Ducoin :\\nça tourne bien » ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_12",
      "hash64": "E12DB657CA13FC4D",
      "text": "... T’en dis quoi ? Il craint pas trop, mon titre,\\non est d’accord ?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_13",
      "hash64": "E12DB557CA13FA9A",
      "text": "Bah, ça ira bien comme ça !\\nMonsieur Ducoin, je compte sur vous ![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "3DA8B350A77FB23F",
      "text": "Comme je suis redevable à la Ligue Pokémon\\npour tout ce qu’elle fait pour l’académie, je suis\\r\\nvenu apporter mon aide.\\c\\nJe compte sur votre collaboration amicale.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
